{"title":"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 38","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of a trapezoidal field is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/7/2d751cd0b479bceb949355d9a385b9b0fcddaa3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1400$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> square yards. Its altitude is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> yards. Find the two bases, if the number of yards in each base is an integer divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The number of solutions to this problem is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/b/37b1262b507bfa3b692d13cdaec8c35b26d7e42f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{none} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{one} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{two} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{three} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{more than three}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"542\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let us denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/f/90fa86a7f5ff838a1441df13398d87031cabaada.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8m$\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88f825e8eca022f48ac1d2d41cd80ad6e5d9ef9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8n$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> to be our bases. Without loss of generality, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/e/5deb651b747daf94891c9213a616a1c1de03bfc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/7/1471e500538e266a6ef73ee9fe4ce4a05521aff5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[50 * \\frac{8m + 8n}{2} = 1400\\]\" width=\"165\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf290b7e13ff6e12abac868b2b6afd21d6ceff45.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4m + 4n = 28\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/0/4f0c72d03b86a57185c4c9991cd1230fe52eee4f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m + n = 7\\]\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> &amp; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are integers, we see that the only solutions to this equation are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/1/621f951230bd018717e8c0c5cd3bfd6b1f8720a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/9/ea9d3308a17610dcb38bfd84b443bdd0ea403605.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/f/97fadfe6bdbd1adb164f263b52f2a290723ad45c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />. \nTherefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88d8d2a5e63854e3230dc46f9c2cd559ba97402.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{(D) three}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"79\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME\" title=\"1952 AHSME\">1952 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1952 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1952\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">Problem 37</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">Problem 39</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" titl